      players: 'Three to five players (four or more in some descriptions; best with 4–6).',
      deck: '54 cards: standard 52 plus two distinguishable jokers (Red and Black). Rank order 3 low to A, then 2, Black Joker, Red Joker.',
      equipment: 'Cards',
      dealing: 'Dealt singly anticlockwise from dealer until pack is exhausted; depending on player count some players may have one more card.',
